{
  "id": 107374889,
  "iid": 3586,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "tns: fix decoding of a complex lengthy strings",
  "description": "Strings which are longer than 64 bytes are decoded very differently.\nSimply their format looks like this:\n\n```\n  if size(Data) < 64:\n          << size(Data)/1 byte, Data/Size bytes >>.\n   else:\n          << 254/1 byte, 64/1 byte, Data[0:63]/64 byte, ..., size(Data) rem 64/1 byte, Data[:size(Data) rem 64]/size(Data) rem 64,  0/1 byte >>\n```\n\nSigned-off-by: Peter Lemenkov <lemenkov@gmail.com>",
