      "title": "tns: fix decoding of a complex lengthy strings",
      "message": "tns: fix decoding of a complex lengthy strings\n\nStrings which are longer than 64 bytes are decoded very differently.\nSimply their format looks like this:\n\n . if size(Data) < 64:\n .         << size(Data)/1 byte, Data/Size bytes >>.\n .  else:\n .         << 254/1 byte, 64/1 byte, Data[0:63]/64 byte, ..., size(Data) rem 64/1 byte, Data[:size(Data) rem 64]/size(Data) rem 64,  0/1 byte >>\n\nChange-Id: If6619f61ee8af1979a3f26417a645bc791a4bbb3\nSigned-off-by: Peter Lemenkov <lemenkov@gmail.com>\n",
      "author_name": "Peter Lemenkov",
      "author_email": "lemenkov@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-07-08T00:57:52.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Peter Lemenkov",
      "committer_email": "lemenkov@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2022-05-23T16:20:46.000+02:00",
